# ENEMY 3 (built-in)
training 0x70892B08 "ENEMY 3"
builtin

step "-Hit anywhere to get their attention when far away."               until snakes_attention >= 1
step "-They will STRIKE then SPIN when close."                           until snakes_spin >= 1
step "-Hit the heads to deal damage, causing hazards to be left behind." until snakes_head_hit >= 2
step "-Defeat the enemy to remove the hazards."                          until snakes_kill >= 2
step "-STOMP near the heads to STUN, causing them to take more damage."  until snakes_stomp_stun >= 2

keep 1 snakes every 1
